---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import ReplayDashboard from '../components/islands/ReplayDashboard.jsx';
---
<Base title="Demo" theme="dark" description="Replay a simulated two-hour UAV mission in the browser and watch turbocharger wear pull exhaust gas temperature away from the healthy twin.">
  <PageHead title="Replay the mission" lead="Two hours of simulated flight, from takeoff to shutdown. Press play or drag the timeline to watch the fault appear, cross the watch band and get flagged." />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 class="visually-hidden">Replay dashboard</h2>
      <ReplayDashboard client:load />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="stack">
        <h2 class="display" style="font-size:var(--step-3)">The MATLAB dashboard</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>The same pipeline runs in our MATLAB app: pick a mission, a fault and a severity, run the physics and fault simulation, inspect telemetry, CAN frames and graphs, and export the CAN dataset for the AI work.</p>
        <p class="placeholder" role="note">Screenshots and a short screen recording of the MATLAB dashboard will be added here.</p>
        <p>Everything on this page is read from files exported from that simulation. When the simulation is re-run, the replay updates without code changes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap"><a class="next-link" href="/validation/"><span>Next</span><strong>Validation</strong></a></div>
</Base>
<style>
  .placeholder { border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong); padding: var(--s-5); color: var(--ink-3); }
</style>
